OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FDrivers have stolen an average of
OL,8,Falmost #200,000 worth of fuel from UK
OL,9,Fforecourts every day since the start
OL,10,Fof the Iran oil crisis, according to
OL,11,Fanalysis.
OL,13,FFuel theft prevention company
OL,14,FForecourt Eye said incidents of fuel
OL,15,Ftaken without payment soared by 20% in
OL,16,Fthe five months after the conflict
OL,17,Fbegan on February 28, compared with
OL,18,Fthe preceding five months.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThe increase in pump prices driven by
OL,8,Fthe war means the value of stolen fuel
OL,9,Frose by 48% over the same period,
OL,10,Freaching an estimated daily average of
OL,11,F#194,000 across the UK's 8,359
OL,12,Fforecourts.
OL,14,FFor first-time offenders, there was a
OL,15,F23% increase in the number of
OL,16,Fincidents and a 26% rise in the volume
OL,17,Fof fuel stolen, compared with 17% and
OL,18,F20% respectively among repeat
OL,19,Foffenders.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThe figures are based on reports by a
OL,8,Frepresentative sample of 550
OL,9,Fforecourts.
OL,11,FThey include drive-offs, when there is
OL,12,Fno attempt to pay, and no means of
OL,13,Fpayment incidents, when a customer
OL,14,Ffills up and claims they have no way
OL,15,Fto pay.
OL,17,FThe average price of a litre of petrol
OL,18,Fclimbed to 160p on Friday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FThat was about 27p more than before
OL,8,Fthe conflict, and represented a three-
OL,9,Fand-a-half-year high.
OL,11,FThe average price of diesel is about
OL,12,F37p per litre higher than before the
OL,13,Fwar, at 179p.
OL,15,FForecourt Eye is partnering with
OL,16,FFacewatch to offer free access to
OL,17,Fcrime reporting technology to its
OL,18,Fcustomers, which it said will make it
OL,19,Feasier to record fuel thefts, shop
OL,20,Fcrime and other illegal incidents.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FUsers will also have the option of
OL,8,Fjoining a live facial recognition
OL,9,Fnetwork run by Facewatch to alert them
OL,10,Fto known offenders.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FForecourt Eye managing director,
OL,8,FMichelle Henchoz, said: "As offending
OL,9,Fbecomes more organised and more
OL,10,Fsophisticated, operators need joined-
OL,11,Fup technology that helps them protect
OL,12,Fboth their forecourt and their
OL,13,Fconvenience store."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FGordon Balmer, executive director of
OL,8,Fthe Petrol Retailers Association,
OL,9,Fwhich represents independent
OL,10,Fforecourts, said its members are
OL,11,F"reporting increasing levels of abuse
OL,12,Fand aggression towards colleagues who
OL,13,Fare simply doing their jobs and have
OL,14,Fno influence over the price displayed
OL,15,Fon the forecourt".
OL,17,FHe continued: "Bringing together
OL,18,Ftechnologies that help retailers
OL,19,Fprevent crime, manage incidents and
OL,20,Fsupport police investigations is a
OL,21,Fpositive step for the industry."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FBen Lawrence, a director at Lawrences
OL,8,FGarages, which owns five petrol
OL,9,Fstations situated in Norfolk and
OL,10,FHampshire, said fuel thefts were
OL,11,Fhistorically often carried out by
OL,12,Fpeople involved in other crimes, but
OL,13,Frises in the cost of living mean this
OL,14,Fis no longer the case.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1785759510
OL,3,CFuel theft: Nearly #200,000 stolen
OL,4,Cfrom UK forecourts daily during Iran
OL,5,Cwar
OL,7,FHe said there is a "misconception"
OL,8,Fthat all forecourts featuring branding
OL,9,Ffrom energy giants such as BP and
OL,10,FShell are operated by those companies,
OL,11,Frather than smaller businesses, so
OL,12,Fsome drivers believe it "doesn't
OL,13,Fmatter" when they fail to pay.
OL,15,F"It does matter to us," he went on.
OL,17,F"When someone drives off (after taking
OL,18,Ffuel worth) #80-#90, it's hitting us,
OL,19,Fnot the oil companies.
OL,21,F"We've already purchased it."
